{"4276030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lab Loonies", "steam_appid": 4276030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lab Loonies is an exploration of why humans shouldn't be trusted with simple tasks. You and up to three &quot;colleagues&quot; will step into our clean, grid-lined lab to navigate perfectly logical, definitely-not-rigged puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276030/extras/4b70b374dd4e82ef8ebe56eda4916f90.poster.avif?t=1786409774\" width=780 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276030/extras/4b70b374dd4e82ef8ebe56eda4916f90.webm?t=1786409774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276030/extras/4b70b374dd4e82ef8ebe56eda4916f90.mp4?t=1786409774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lab Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reliable Narration: Our resident AI Drone has your best interest at heart. He will provide &quot;encouraging&quot; feedback on your performance and dynamically alter the levels to ensure your... satisfaction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teamwork (Optional): Work together with up to 4 colleagues to complete each task, or use them as a stepping stone. The Lab doesn't judge you; it only records data.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fair-ish Level Design: 50+ rooms featuring straightforward, honest tasks. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comprehensive Testing: 2+ hours of puzzles that respect your time (by making you repeat them 40 times)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zero Jump scares: We prefer &quot;Rapid Environment Transitions&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276030/extras/ed5fcacfc78b80863900fc870f510292.poster.avif?t=1786409774\" width=780 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276030/extras/ed5fcacfc78b80863900fc870f510292.webm?t=1786409774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276030/extras/ed5fcacfc78b80863900fc870f510292.mp4?t=1786409774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lab Loonies is an exploration of why humans shouldn't be trusted with simple tasks. You and up to three &quot;colleagues&quot; will step into our clean, grid-lined lab to navigate perfectly logical, definitely-not-rigged puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276030/extras/4b70b374dd4e82ef8ebe56eda4916f90.poster.avif?t=1786409774\" width=780 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276030/extras/4b70b374dd4e82ef8ebe56eda4916f90.webm?t=1786409774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276030/extras/4b70b374dd4e82ef8ebe56eda4916f90.mp4?t=1786409774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lab Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reliable Narration: Our resident AI Drone has your best interest at heart. He will provide &quot;encouraging&quot; feedback on your performance and dynamically alter the levels to ensure your... satisfaction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teamwork (Optional): Work together with up to 4 colleagues to complete each task, or use them as a stepping stone. The Lab doesn't judge you; it only records data.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fair-ish Level Design: 50+ rooms featuring straightforward, honest tasks. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comprehensive Testing: 2+ hours of puzzles that respect your time (by making you repeat them 40 times)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zero Jump scares: We prefer &quot;Rapid Environment Transitions&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276030/extras/ed5fcacfc78b80863900fc870f510292.poster.avif?t=1786409774\" width=780 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276030/extras/ed5fcacfc78b80863900fc870f510292.webm?t=1786409774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276030/extras/ed5fcacfc78b80863900fc870f510292.mp4?t=1786409774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>", "short_description": "Lab Loonies is a physics-based descent into madness where &quot;logic&quot; is a suggestion the developer ignored. In this 1-4 player lab experiment, the platforms are lying, the physics are &quot;opinionated,&quot; and the Narrator is actively rooting for your demise. Make good choices, or don't. The Lab doesn't judge", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276030/8c6f56f453d5d99fb8519ff992425bfad8da1c1f/header.jpg?t=1786409774", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/427603